### 1. GET all students
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### 2. GET student by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/students/101

### 3. POST add a student
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 106,
  "name": "Amit Kumar",
  "email": "amit@kiet.edu",
  "branch": "CSE",
  "year": 2,
  "cgpa": 8.75
}

### 4. PUT update a student
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 101,
  "name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul@kiet.edu",
  "branch": "CSE",
  "year": 3,
  "cgpa": 9.05
}

### 5. DELETE a student
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/105

### 6. Search by branch and year
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search?branch=CSE&year=2

### 7. Find students with CGPA >= 9.0
GET http://localhost:8080/students/topper?cgpa=9.0
